<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said on Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale.</p>
<p>--Dawson County School District, Ga., GOs, $5.91 million.</p>
<p>--Quincy, Mass., GOs., $12.335 million.</p>
<p>--St Louis County Housing Redevelopment, Minn., Revenue bonds, $5.275 million.</p>
<p>--Hamilton County, Tenn., GOs, $53 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
